") 100 x 8mm 3.937 \" x 0.394\" (3/8\") 100 x 10mm B. Square 3.937 \" x 0.157\" (5/32\") 100 x 4mm 3.937 \" x 0.236\" (1/4\") 100 x 6mm 3.937 \" x 0.315\" (5/16\") 100 x 8mm 3.937 \" x 0.394\" (3/8\") 100 x 10mm 4.75\" x 0.512\" (1/2\") 120 x 13mm C. Round, Pointed 3.937 \" x 0.157\" (5/32\") 100 x 4mm D. Round 3.937 \" x 0.157\" (5/32\") 100 x 4mm 3.937 \" x 0.236\" (1/4\") 100 x 6mm 3.937 \" x 0.315\" (5/16\") 100 x 8mm 3.937 \" x 0.394\" (3/8\") 100 x 10mm E. Flat 3.937 \" x 0.236\" ( 1/4\") x 0.118\" (1/8\") 100 x 6 x 3mm 3.937 \" x 0.315\" ( 5/16\") x 0.236\" (1/4\") 100 x 8 x6mm F. Half-Round Available in Medium & Coarse only. Refer to Medium page or Coarse page . G. Rhomboid Available in Coarse only. Refer to Coarse page. H. Round Tapered 3.937 \" x 1.181\" (1-3/16\") X 0.276\" (1/4\") > 0.079\" (3/32\") 100 x 30 x 7>2mm I. Knife 3.937 \" x 0.591\" (19/32\") x 0.118\" (1/8\") > 0.020 (1/32\") 100 x 15 x 3>0.5mm * Inches and fractions are Approximate. **All mm dimensions have tolerance of ±0.1mm. NOTE: Because Degussit DD57 is a homogenous ceramic material which is bondfree, these stones cannot be classified in terms of \"grit\" but only in terms of the average grain size. The average grain size of types \"fine\" and \"medium\" is about 10µ. Type \"coarse\" has two average grain sizes at about 10µ and 100µ. Show More Product Specifications Brand: DEGUSSIT® Abrasive: Ruby Crystals Abrasive Grit: Fine Abrasive Type: Ruby Country of Origin: Germany Dimension: 10 x 10 x 100mm Package Size: Single Stone Shape: Square",
