    "name": "Speed Brite Turbo 309SB Ionic Cleaner",
    "slug": "speed-brite-turbo-309sb-ionic-cleaner",
    "description": "Product Description The Speed Brite ionic process cleans precious metal and stones in less than a minute. The TURBO version features a vibrating motor that helps circulate the dirt and tarnish away from jewelry even faster. Safe for emeralds, opals, pearls, turquoise and other soft stones that cannot be cleaned in an ultrasonic or steam cleaner. Features: Cleans gold and silver in seconds. Perfect for both small and large jewelry items as well as flatware. Diamonds & gemstones will glisten. One-year warranty. Includes: Turbo model with 36oz capacity tank 110V Power Adapter (also sold separately as 8514949) Stainless Steel Tray Stainless Steel Ring Bar Lid Detachable Clip Wire Cleaning Brush 32oz. GemSparkle Concentrate an environmentally safe cleaning solution formulated to gently remove dirt, grime and light tarnish. (also sold separately). ISpeed Brite Cleaners work by electrolysis. Ions are attached to dirt and grease rather than metals and stones. Surface tension is reduced permitting dirt, tarnish and oxidation to be lifted away from jewelry or other metal pieces with gentle bubbles without abrasion. No metal is lost. Stones are safely cleaned without potentially damaging friction, heat or abrasion that other cleaners produce. Rinsing and drying after immersion naturally enhances renewed luster. Ionic cleaning is at the same time gentle and powerful. Because Speed Brite's ionic cleaning is done at room temperature and without cavitation it has been found to be SAFE for all gemstones. No heat or sound waves are used in the ionic process; simply bubbles releasing tarnish and oxidation from metal as stones are bathed in the Gem Sparkle solution. Note: There is no sound in this video. Show More Product Specifications Brand: Speed Brite Capacity: 36 oz. Country of Origin: United States of America Electrical: 100V/240V Item Length: 10.75\" Item Height: 6.75\" Model: 300SB Tank Capacity: 1.125 quart 1.06 liter Warranty Term: 1 Year",
